  "description": "Piper offline voice engine for uTPro.Feature.TextToSpeech. Adds fast, fully local server-side voices (no API key, no outbound traffic) by running the Piper binary you provide against .onnx voice models you download - including Vietnamese. Registers itself through the TextToSpeech engine collection, so no edits to the core package or the host Program.cs are needed. Windows and Linux.",
